              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 目标\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Data.List.Basic`\n\n**角色** 目标定理\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Type u} {β : Type v} {γ : Type w} (g : β → γ) (f : α → β), List.map g ∘ List.map f = List.map (g ∘ f)\n```\n\n**文档**\nComposing a `List.map` with another `List.map` is equal to\na single `List.map` of composed functions.",
