                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "edec8ce9-4049-4428-b593-3432b7042ced",
                      "text": "文档: A single `List.map` of a composition of functions is equal to composing a `List…",
                      "children": [],
                      "isExpanded": true,
                      "parentId": "1bf1e063-ad31-4c83-886b-d83795af4fbb",
                      "data": {
                        "note": "**文档**\n\nA single `List.map` of a composition of functions is equal to\ncomposing a `List.map` with another `List.map`, fully applied.\nThis is the reverse direction of `List.map_map`.",
                        "tags": [
                          "attribute",
                          "文档"
                        ]
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "background": "#f9fafb",
                        "color": "#6b7280",
                        "fontSize": 11,
                        "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "isExpanded": false,
                  "parentId": "26398fcc-c2ee-4c19-9aae-c749e2c88ca8",
                  "data": {
                    "tags": [
                      "attribute-group"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f3f4f6",
                    "color": "#4b5563",
                    "fontSize": 12,
                    "shape": "round",
                    "borderColor": "#d1d5db"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "4b888ba7-012e-4d9d-b918-f6d29b0dc558",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Data.List.Basic`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Type u} {β : Type v} {γ : Type w} (h : β → γ) (g : α → β) (l : List α), List.map (h ∘ g) l = List.map h (List.map g l)\n```\n\n**文档**\nA single `List.map` of a composition of functions is equal to\ncomposing a `List.map` with another `List.map`, fully applied.\nThis is the reverse direction of `List.map_map`.",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "证明",
                  "theorem"
                ]
              },
