                    {
                      "id": "b69ca0d9-a1b9-4295-b19b-7ab9424f76ff",
                      "text": "文档: The length of a list. This function is overridden in the compiler to `lengthTR`…",
                      "children": [],
                      "isExpanded": true,
                      "parentId": "96297307-758d-4879-b325-f4275486740d",
                      "data": {
                        "note": "**文档**\n\nThe length of a list.\n\nThis function is overridden in the compiler to `lengthTR`, which uses constant stack space.\n\nExamples:\n* `([] : List String).length = 0`\n* `[\"green\", \"brown\"].length = 2`",
                        "tags": [
                          "attribute",
                          "文档"
                        ]
