                "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u_1} → List α → ℕ\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe length of a list.\n\nThis function is overridden in the compiler to `lengthTR`, which uses constant stack space.\n\nExamples:\n* `([] : List String).length = 0`\n* `[\"green\", \"brown\"].length = 2`",
