                    {
                      "id": "2b3d20d5-c18f-4b2b-84f9-ba83bd079c3b",
                      "text": "文档: Applies a function to each element of the list, returning the resulting list of…",
                      "children": [],
                      "isExpanded": true,
                      "parentId": "a469ffe7-1be8-4973-90b8-edb82fafd4d6",
                      "data": {
                        "note": "**文档**\n\nApplies a function to each element of the list, returning the resulting list of values.\n\n`O(|l|)`.\n\nExamples:\n* `[a, b, c].map f = [f a, f b, f c]`\n* `[].map Nat.succ = []`\n* `[\"one\", \"two\", \"three\"].map (·.length) = [3, 3, 5]`\n* `[\"one\", \"two\", \"three\"].map (·.reverse) = [\"eno\", \"owt\", \"eerht\"]`",
                        "tags": [
                          "attribute",
                          "文档"
                        ]
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "background": "#f9fafb",
                        "color": "#6b7280",
                        "fontSize": 11,
                        "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "isExpanded": false,
