                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "f14ca66d-1a1f-4dfb-956e-1d0a64605b52",
                          "text": "文档: Function composition, usually written with the infix operator `∘`. A new functi…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "05c9f524-1623-4935-958b-c06f55bae90f",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\nFunction composition, usually written with the infix operator `∘`. A new function is created from\ntwo existing functions, where one function's output is used as input to the other.\n\nExamples:\n * `Function.comp List.reverse (List.drop 2) [3, 2, 4, 1] = [1, 4]`\n * `(List.reverse ∘ List.drop 2) [3, 2, 4, 1] = [1, 4]`",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "文档"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "isExpanded": false,
                      "parentId": "7b461f1b-c7b8-4498-9230-0792df470890",
                      "data": {
                        "tags": [
                          "attribute-group"
                        ]
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "background": "#f3f4f6",
                        "color": "#4b5563",
                        "fontSize": 12,
                        "shape": "round",
                        "borderColor": "#d1d5db"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "341d2dc3-716e-45b2-9b91-25110494433e",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Sort u} → {β : Sort v} → {δ : Sort w} → (β → δ) → (α → β) → α → δ\n```\n\n**文档**\nFunction composition, usually written with the infix operator `∘`. A new function is created from\ntwo existing functions, where one function's output is used as input to the other.\n\nExamples:\n * `Function.comp List.reverse (List.drop 2) [3, 2, 4, 1] = [1, 4]`\n * `(List.reverse ∘ List.drop 2) [3, 2, 4, 1] = [1, 4]`",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "陈述",
                      "definition"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f8fbff",
                    "color": "#1e3a8a",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#93c5fd"
                  }
                },
                {
