                        {
                          "id": "de86e746-35c4-45c6-9685-26b5da3ba710",
                          "text": "文档: Optional values, which are either `some` around a value from the underlying typ…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "8722fb8c-53f9-480d-8b72-729aa3769d78",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\nOptional values, which are either `some` around a value from the underlying type or `none`.\n\n`Option` can represent nullable types or computations that might fail. In the codomain of a function\ntype, it can also represent partiality.",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "文档"
                            ]
                          },
