                        {
                          "id": "9847e700-0fd7-4e2d-85a0-109a8a7724a0",
                          "text": "文档: The syntax `arr[i]?` gets the `i`'th element of the collection `arr`, if it is …",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "741f00d3-9b83-43c6-9b61-e7fcf6c9b17f",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\nThe syntax `arr[i]?` gets the `i`'th element of the collection `arr`,\nif it is present (and wraps it in `some`), and otherwise returns `none`.",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
