                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.GetElem`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{coll : Type u} → {idx : Type v} → {elem : outParam (Type w)} → {valid : outParam (coll → idx → Prop)} → [self : GetElem? coll idx elem valid] → coll → idx → Option elem\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe syntax `arr[i]?` gets the `i`'th element of the collection `arr`,\nif it is present (and wraps it in `some`), and otherwise returns `none`.",
